    {
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "GoPro-streaming med GoPro Quick-appen",
      "id": "gopro-streaming-med-gopro-quick-appen"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h2 id=\"gopro-streaming-med-gopro-quick-appen\"><a href=\"#gopro-streaming-med-gopro-quick-appen\">GoPro-streaming med GoPro Quick-appen</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Öppna GoPro Quick-appen",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Anslut din GoPro-kamera</li>\n<li>Gå till <strong>GoPro</strong> – Undermeny</li>\n<li>Gå till <strong>GoPro Settings</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/be731519f338ca01.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2107
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "GoPro-inställningar",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Gå till <strong>Live Stream</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/655af611889d3dea.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2107
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set Up Live",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Gå till <strong>Other/RTMP</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/362dbd9e09f7c19b.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2107
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Stream to Other/RTMP 1",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Anslut till ett Wi-Fi-nätverk – <strong>Select a Wi-Fi Network</strong></li>\n<li>Ange den RTMPS-adress som MTX ger – <strong>Enter your RTMP URL</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/2501089abd2c3fe6.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2107
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Stream to Other/RTMP 2",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Kontrollera Wi-Fi-anslutningen</li>\n<li>Kontrollera strömningsadressen</li>\n<li>Kontrollera upplösningen</li>\n<li>Gå till <strong>Continue</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/9642a60ab2fb99d5.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2107
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Go Live",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Vänta tills anslutningen upprättas</li>\n<li>Gå till <strong>Go Live</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/8865398b3a5be967.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2107
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Streaming Live",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Direktsändning pågår</li>\n<li>När sändningen är klar, avsluta genom att trycka på <strong>Stop-knappen</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/8665eaf7f1f838f3.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2107
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Nu vet du hur man streamar",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Du kan stänga denna guide.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>När du har startat streamen, fortsätt till avsnittet <a href=\"/doc/ce8883ca-0875-427b-88c6-464f3ebcc0e9\">Katso Striimiä</a></p>"
    }
  ]
